+--!strict
+-- The Cinderveil crown (zone armour, Aor'lan Mountain): a basalt circlet set
+-- with a magma seam, a low crown of black crystal shards raking up and back,
+-- a dark cap and veil at the nape, and one sulphur chip at the tallest shard.
+-- Every shard closes inward as it rises, so the head reads tall from the high
+-- camera and never wide at ear level.
+local ArmourLookTypes = require("../../ArmourLookTypes")
+local Kit = require("./Kit")
+
+local C = {
+	basalt = { 50, 48, 55 },
+	basaltDeep = { 34, 33, 40 },
